github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/deployments","created_at":"2016-09-15T16:40:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T05:34:58Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T03:27:24Z","git_url":"git://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:microsoft/vcpkg.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg","homepage":"","size":96040,"stargazers_count":26254,"watchers_count":26254,"language":"CMake","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":7235,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1320,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["c","cmake","cplusplus","cpp","libraries","package-manager","packages","vcpkg","visual-studio","windows"],"visibility":"public","forks":7235,"open_issues":1320,"watchers":26254,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"A project using Boost does not link when a -static triplet is used. This has two reasons, both related to boost's autolink support (in boost/config/auto_link.hpp) and library renaming.\r\n\r\n- The name of any static library is expected to be prefixed with \"lib\"\r\n- Currently, static Boost implies static CRT, and static-CRT libraries' names must contain the \"s\" flag\r\n\r\nBoth these elements are removed by library renaming in boost/portfile.cmake .\r\n\r\nA crude fix is to condition all renaming on (VCPKG_LIBRARY_LINKAGE STREQUAL dynamic), i. e. move the lines into the condition directly above. This appears to fix MSBuild. A better fix may be to `#define BOOST_ALL_NO_LIB` in user.hpp, i.e. disable Boost's autolink feature entirely. Because vcpkg always and indiscriminately adds `*.lib` to the linker command line, all Boost libraries are found anyway.\r\n\r\nAs for CMake, I cannot say what needs to be done because I have not been able to get a CMake project to work; `find_package(Boost)` only works if I define VCPKG_PREFIX_PATH and include the triplet directory. AFAICT, this is not intended to be necessary.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/483/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/483/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"ras0219-msft","id":12301622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzAxNjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12301622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft","html_url":"https://github.com/ras0219-msft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras021